null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQ3YcHCGUoAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQ3IcHCGQoDg",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["藏身蘆洲的老字號，默默經營數十載。\n\n主角鯖魚，水嫩油潤、火候恰好，每一口都能感受到魚脂在舌尖輕柔化開，外酥內嫩，是經年累月的經驗堆疊出的完美熟度。\n\n配角牛蒡絲與海帶絲小菜，調味淡雅恰到好處，像知心好友般不搶風頭，卻讓整套餐吃起來層次更豐富。\n湯品方面也毫不馬虎，海鮮髮菜羹濃郁鮮甜，味噌湯溫潤不死鹹，雙湯登場，誠意十足，暖胃也暖心。\n\n飯後招待的冰冰涼涼綠豆湯——清甜不膩，喝下去有種「今天真值得」的滿足感。\n\n💰全套只要220元？這價錢在現在物價上太空的年代，簡直佛心來著。",null,[0,74]]]],[],[null,null,7865,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMN2U2aGxnRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x7a0a79ca53912bcb!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICL7e6hlgE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMN2U2aGxnRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMN2U2aGxnRRIsChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNMN2U2aFZnEhJDZ3NJeUpDY3dRWVFrSkw3TVEaLgoXQ0lITTBvZ0tFSUNBZ0lDTDdlNmgxZ0USE0Nnd0l2Wkxhc3dZUTJNdllnUU0iEgkAAAAAAAAAABHLK5FTynkKeioLMGM4a1c3NUVnWkY\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQoykIZigP"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwjR7c-CzdKWAxUodV4EHXq4JwYQ0pMFCAIoAA"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQ0pMFCEwoAA"],[["ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNfNk1QRTNBRRAB",["0x0:0x7a0a79ca53912bcb",null,1736686380598587,1736686380598587,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104187392095037437558/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["U Chung","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUeqS_WlLA9S5M2wQoQaGcC82Z9b4W0RmCU86qYFYlfxbxY_LkP\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104187392095037437558?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"104187392095037437558",null,156,2160,null,[1,8,1],0,["在地嚮導 · 156 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQpr8GCGgoAA"]]]],null,"1 年前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/p