小小孩的音量有時真的偏大，謝謝服務人員還幫忙哄"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:OTHER_DIETARY_RESTRICTIONS"],"特殊餐點",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQ3YcHCMkBKAA"],[["E:KID_FRIENDLINESS"],"親子友善程度",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQ3YcHCMoBKAE"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQ3IcHCMgBKBA",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["從小吃到大的三十年在地老店，前些日子重新裝潢後菜單也重新調整過，覺得口味及擺盤都更勝以往！超推薦這裡的無菜單料理，只要告知師傅預算及喜好，即可享用到菜單外的驚喜！\n（也可以去吧檯看今天有什麼新鮮魚貨和隱藏版料理唷，畢竟一個禮拜來吃六天還是需要一點變化！）\n\n相較於純日式料理來說份量很足夠，不管是一個人的午晚餐，或者是家庭聚會，招待客戶都是非常棒的選擇（二樓包廂很適合暢談暢飲！）外帶的綜合便當也很澎湃，客戶都誇不停～\n\n老店也許服務不是最頂尖的，但卻最溫暖，下班後的疲憊在吧檯與老闆聊聊天小酌兩杯後一掃而空！\n謝謝辛苦的老闆和服務人員們！不收服務費也提供很完整的服務，每次想不到吃什麼就一定會想到這裡，很有家的感覺。",null,[0,127]]]],[],[null,null,20322,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNlajVQOEZREAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x7a0a79ca53912bcb!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgICej5P8FQ%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNlajVQOEZREAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNlajVQOEZREi0KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJQ2VqNmU2cVFFEhJDZ3NJbllQS21RWVE4TFcwWFEaLgoXQ0lITTBvZ0tFSUNBZ0lDZWo1UDhsUUUSE0Nnd0lyTzdKbVFZUTJLX3U0UUkiEgkAAAAAAAAAABHLK5FTynkKeioLMFlCYzVTQWZHZms\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQoykIywEoEQ"],null,[null,[[1,8]]]],"0ahUKEwjR7c-CzdKWAxUodV4EHXq4JwYQ0pMFCGAoAw"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQ0pMFCKoBKAM"],[["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURleUtEb0d3EAE",["0x0:0x7a0a79ca53912bcb",null,1664544060273710,1664544060273710,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110361410775272478006/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Sabrina Huang (薩賓娜)","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWBIsgyw4H6d1tub2q9_6n_Jronw0QspmcrJGs0YcaDIzLVjvyPMA\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110361410775272478006?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"1103614107752