0元的消費中覺得最滿意的。\n整體來說，餐點價格偏貴，加上服務人員送餐和收拾餐盤都很「突然」使得用餐體驗不太舒服，且明明在杯盤旁邊有滿滿的濕紙巾卻沒有主動提供，是一家吃一次暫時不會想回訪的店。",null,[0,100]]]],[],[null,null,7569,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURleUtEb0d3EAE!2m1!1s0x0:0x7a0a79ca53912bcb!3m1!1s2@1:CIHM0ogKEICAgIDeyKDoGw%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURleUtEb0d3EAE\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURleUtEb0d3Ei4KF0NJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRGV5S0RvbXdFEhNDZ3dJdk5yYm1RWVFzUGZCZ2dFGi0KFkNJSE0wb2dLRUlDQWdJRGV5S0RvV3cSE0Nnd0l2TnJibVFZUXNQZkJnZ0UiEgkAAAAAAAAAABHLK5FTynkKeioLMFlDaW93Rko2aWs\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQoykI2gEoBw"],null,[null,[[1,3]]]],"0ahUKEwjR7c-CzdKWAxUodV4EHXq4JwYQ0pMFCIIBKAQ"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQ0pMFCMwBKAQ"],[["ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNKOTdiYkxBEAE",["0x0:0x7a0a79ca53912bcb",null,1688708512542635,1688708645139072,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116841123208007503834/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["Ella Lin","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUuyq0jcYY4mJPrTmzrldMxAb9NfysrOF0u-XBVywbf3IVqTG-uSg\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116841123208007503834?hl\u003dzh-TW"],"116841123208007503834",null,19,13,null,[1,4,1],4,["在地嚮導 · 19 則評論",null,null,null,null,[null,"0ahUKEwjppcWCzdKWAxWodvUHHVJvDewQpr8GCNwBKAA"]]]],null,"3 年前",null,null,null,null,null,null,["Google","https://www.gstatic.com/images/branding/product/1x/googleg_48dp.png",null,null,5],null,1],[[3],null,[["CIHM0ogKEICAgICJ97bb7AE",["CIHM0ogKEICAgICJ97bb7AE",10,12,null,null,null,["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/grass-cs/ACvplmNETWpKPZ7XQefWBZz_svPx7FDEO_nT9tvEuuFSpxnx93b0kYIdA4UDLNBhIQweoBPrNT0WdW-qOJH4iphFvyV34gsyyvNniJx7_jSYEPaFYooWKklYx471WXfYAaUGmHrQFQNu\u003dk-no",null,[858,417]],null,[[3,121.4705509007837,25.08751428265448],[0,90],[858,417],75],"gIGZaunlN6jt1e8P0t614A4","0ahUKEwjppcW